##WORK IN PROGRESS##

Who was the client? What type of software did they want you to design?

The client was a company by the name of The Gaming Room.  They were in the market for a web-based game based on their hit Android game, Draw It or Lose It.  
The game was similar to the 1980's game "Win, Lose or Draw where teams would compete to guess what is being drawn.  T
he client wanted to be able to bring their game to multiple different platforms instead of it only being available as an Android application.

